The '''Vice-chairman of the Industrial Party of Burawa''' is a senior leadership position within the [[Industrial Party of Burawa]], subordinate to the [[Chairman of the Industrial Party of Burawa]]. The vice-chairman serves as deputy to the party leader and assumes leadership responsibilities in the chairman's absence.

The position is filled by vote of the party congress, which convenes to elect party leadership.

